actual:
```typescript
describe('Login', () => {
  it('logs in successfully', () => {
    cy.intercept('POST', '/api/login', { statusCode: 200 }).as('loginReq');
    cy.get('[data-testid="login-button"]').click();
    cy.wait('@loginReq');
    cy.get('[data-testid="dashboard"]').should('be.visible');
  })
})
```

I will not use a fixed cy.wait(3000) because it introduces flakiness. Instead, you should wait for the actual state to change. 

```typescript
cy.get('[data-testid="loader"]').should('not.exist');
cy.get('[data-testid="content"]').should('be.visible');
```
